# Guild security adapter (optional — demo / local-demo is default)
# Never commit real tokens. Never set NEXT_PUBLIC_* for secrets.
#
# GUILD_SECURITY_MODE=demo
# GUILD_API_TOKEN=
# GUILD_API_KEY=
#
# Even with credentials, createAdapter() stays on DemoGuildAdapter until a real
# Guild policy-evaluation SDK/API is wired. Do not invent that API.
